text = "
[b]: Help :[/b]

Roll the Dice. The number that come on the dice is the number of blocks that you need to tap on screen.
A block is shown on the right.
The blocks need to be clicked in order. If the order is not maintained while clicking, a life is lost.
Clicking on empty places also counts as wrong and leads to loss of life.
When 3 lives are lost, the game is over.

"
